 "title": "Polynomial Freiman-Ruzsa conjecture",
 "statement": {
  "text": "In additive combinatorics, a discipline within mathematics, Freiman's theorem is a central result which indicates the approximate structure of sets whose sumset is small. It roughly states that if  is small, then  can be contained in a small generalized arithmetic progression.",
